, PubMed:36096887). LYSET is thus an essential factor for maturation and delivery of lysosomal hydrolases (PubMed:36074822). (Microbial infection) Essential for infection by muliple viruses, including SARS-CoV-2, that utilize activated cathepsins for entry after M6P-dependent lysosomal transport."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}